VAT also deserves early attention. Commercial club subscriptions are generally taxable, while qualifying childcare can be exempt. Bundling services and sharing costs can affect both output VAT and recovery of fit-out VAT. Our illustrative model assumes taxable membership throughout; your actual treatment needs assessing against the final offer. [HMRC club subscriptions guidance](https://www.gov.uk/guidance/clubs-and-associations-vat-responsibilities-notice-7015), [HMRC welfare services guidance](https://www.gov.uk/guidance/welfare-services-and-goods-notice-7012)\
