The Little Houses Group Limited, company **12926635**, was incorporated on **4 October 2020**. It became OurHouse Group Limited in February 2026. [Companies House](https://find-and-update.company-information.service.gov.uk/company/12926635)\
\
Its early structure included:\
\
| Entity | What we can establish |\
|---|---|\
| **The Little Houses Group Limited \'97 12926635** | Original parent and fundraising company. Its own accounts recorded employees, leasehold assets, equipment and borrowing. |\
| **Kensal House Nursery Limited \'97 13669806** | Separate childcare company incorporated in October 2021, controlled by the parent from incorporation. |\
| **Little House Developments Limited \'97 13668864** | Another company controlled by the parent from October 2021; subsequently renamed and now OurHouse Jesse\'92s Limited. Its original name alone does not establish precisely which development functions it performed. |\
\
The subsidiary relationships are recorded in the [nursery\'92s control register](https://find-and-update.company-information.service.gov.uk/company/13669806/persons-with-significant-control) and [the development company\'92s register](https://find-and-update.company-information.service.gov.uk/company/13668864/persons-with-significant-control).\
