The parent\'92s average monthly employee count, including directors, was **five in the period to October 2021**, rising to **14 in the following period to December 2022**. These are company-level figures, not total group headcount. Together with its operating assets, they show that calling it simply \'93the holdco\'94 can obscure its early operational role. [2021 accounts](https://find-and-update.company-information.service.gov.uk/company/12926635/filing-history/MzM1MzcyNzIyOWFkaXF6a2N4/document?format=pdf&download=0), [2022 accounts](https://find-and-update.company-information.service.gov.uk/company/12926635/filing-history/MzQxNTgwOTI5NGFkaXF6a2N4/document?format=pdf&download=0)\
