Commercially, the initial operation combined **Jaego\'92s family club and Kensal House Nursery**. Gardiner\'92s previous Incipio business supplied founder experience; it should not be confused with businesses owned by LHG. His solicitors describe advising on his Incipio exit before helping establish Little Houses. [Steinfeld Law](https://www.steinfeldlaw.co.uk/steinfeld-law-advises-founder-of-the-little-houses-group-on-significant-blackstone-investment/)\
