| Indoor play | 1,200 sq ft |\
| Separate club cr\'e8che | 600 sq ft |\
| Flexible activity/fitness studio | 700 sq ft |\
| Quiet adult work area | 500 sq ft |\
| Central food preparation and service | 450 sq ft |\
| Shared reception, WCs, stores, plant and circulation | 1,350 sq ft |\
| **Total internal allowance** | **10,000 sq ft / approximately 929 m\'b2** |\
