The food operation would need particular scrutiny: serving nursery meals and caf\'e9 customers from a compact central kitchen requires a suitable menu, equipment and service plan.\
\
This allocation excludes a swimming pool and dedicated gym floor. It also excludes gardens, terraces, parking and external servicing.\
