**For property searches, I would distinguish two briefs:**\
\
- **Nursery with hospitality:** approximately **5,000\'966,500 sq ft**, with a caf\'e9/lounge and limited additional activity space.\
- **Nursery with a compact membership club:** approximately **8,000\'9612,000 sq ft**, accommodating separate play, cr\'e8che, studio and adult work space.\
\
Both are search envelopes. \'93Comfortably\'94 can only be established against an actual plan and the number of club users expected at peak times.\
