At **Jaego\'92s**, the published plan shows:\
\
- Ground floor: restaurant, terrace, caf\'e9, gym and reformer studio.\
- First floor: activity studios and cr\'e8che/kids club.\
- Second floor: jungle gym, soft play and coffee bar.\
- Third floor: family living room, caf\'e9 and cinema.\
