At **Jesse\'92s**, one ground-floor section accommodates fitness and indoor play; another accommodates pools, courtyard, family lounge and study. The first floor contains the restaurant, terrace, cr\'e8che/kids club and further studios. [Jesse\'92s floor plan](https://assets.ctfassets.net/58xxl6j7f13w/681taHOk2oeXvv95tzs5pg/74e32ec859e6ec6999798c8214574b31/130226_OurHouse_Jesses_Floorplan.pdf)\
