Their historical presentation describes Jaego\'92s as approximately **20,000 sq ft** and Jesse\'92s as **30,000 sq ft**, but presents the nurseries separately with their area fields left as placeholders. Consequently, those headline figures do not give us a dependable combined-site split. [Operator presentation, pages 34\'9637](https://democracy.lbhf.gov.uk/documents/b23757/Supplementary%2BAgenda%2BA%2B26th-Feb-2024%2B18.30%2BLicensing%2BSub-Committee.pdf?T=9)\
