**We should also avoid assuming every future house contains a full day nursery.**\
\
Orly\'92s current published plan labels a cr\'e8che and kids club, but does not identify a separate full-day nursery. Leo\'92s and Olive\'92s public descriptions likewise promote cr\'e8ches, classes and kids clubs. I have not verified dedicated day-nursery capacities or area allocations for those future locations. [Leo\'92s](https://www.ourhouseclubs.com/clubs/leos-house), [Olive\'92s](https://www.ourhouseclubs.com/clubs/olives-house)\
\
For your first site, **around 10,000 sq ft is a useful working brief**. I would favour efficient premises with ground-floor nursery access to outdoor space, clear separation between nursery and club arrivals, and acoustic separation for the adult area.\
